{
  "sn46.3:0.1": "Linked Discourses 46.3 ",
  "sn46.3:0.2": "1. Mountains ",
  "sn46.3:0.3": "Ethics ",
  "sn46.3:1.1": "“Mendicants, when a mendicant is accomplished in ethics, immersion, knowledge, freedom, or the knowledge and vision of freedom, even the sight of them is very helpful, I say. ",
  "sn46.3:1.2": "Even to hear them, ",
  "sn46.3:1.3": "approach them, ",
  "sn46.3:1.4": "pay homage to them, ",
  "sn46.3:1.5": "recollect them, ",
  "sn46.3:1.6": "or go forth following them is very helpful, I say. ",
  "sn46.3:1.7": "Why is that? ",
  "sn46.3:1.8": "Because after hearing the teaching of such mendicants, a mendicant will live withdrawn in both body and mind, ",
  "sn46.3:1.9": "as they recollect and think about that teaching. ",
  "sn46.3:2.1": "At such a time, a mendicant has initiated the awakening factor of mindfulness; ",
  "sn46.3:2.2": "they develop it ",
  "sn46.3:2.3": "and perfect it. ",
  "sn46.3:2.4": "As they live mindfully in this way they investigate, explore, and inquire into that teaching with wisdom. ",
  "sn46.3:3.1": "At such a time, a mendicant has initiated the awakening factor of investigation of principles; ",
  "sn46.3:3.2": "they develop it ",
  "sn46.3:3.3": "and perfect it. ",
  "sn46.3:3.4": "As they investigate principles with wisdom in this way their energy is roused up and unflagging. ",
  "sn46.3:4.1": "At such a time, a mendicant has initiated the awakening factor of energy; they develop it and perfect it. ",
  "sn46.3:4.2": "When they’re energetic, rapture not